                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "SAD, could be a very ncie game with a little more work!\n\nLets say: \nBIG THINKING: Thats the great part! Big Space, big ships,  Big Stations\nBut that does not apply to the game mechanics. Too long to walk the stations. Too close the Camera to see where you are, no walking-breaks (like go to station-weapon shop).\n\nAnd little interaction with ships like inventory, sell Cargo etc.\n\nCause walking around took nealry 45 minutes.\n\nSo I wont refund, cause the idea is great. And with a little or a lot work it can be what it wants to be.\n\n\n\n",
